  "description": "At first glance, the city of Fukuoka seems like a peaceful one, but under the surface, crime is running rampant. The city's Hakata ward is home to the professionals of the underworld: professional killers, detectives, informants, professional revenge seekers, those skilled in torture, and more. And according to urban legend, a \"killer of professional killers\" has shown up in the city.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)",
